WEBVTT

01:33.927 --> 01:35.136
He's dead.

01:40.183 --> 01:41.267
Who?

01:47.065 --> 01:48.525
I don't know you.

01:51.444 --> 01:52.277
Don't go in there.

01:52.278 --> 01:55.823
- Stop it.
- I am telling you, go back.

01:55.824 --> 01:57.033
No.

02:00.703 --> 02:02.580
His brains are on the floor.

02:08.753 --> 02:10.130
You're lying.

02:53.756 --> 02:55.675
- Hey.
- Hey.

03:01.806 --> 03:03.099
Fuck.

03:09.480 --> 03:10.647
You been out?

03:10.648 --> 03:12.149
Yeah, thought about setting up a watch,

03:12.150 --> 03:14.611
in case one of those patrols
gets too close.

03:15.945 --> 03:18.405
Made it about an hour.

03:18.406 --> 03:19.531
We'll do shifts.

03:19.532 --> 03:21.284
I'll get you something to warm up.

03:21.993 --> 03:23.077
Fuck.

03:24.329 --> 03:26.122
It did not look like that in the dark.

03:26.956 --> 03:29.209
Shit. Hey, you two. Hey. Come on.

03:30.043 --> 03:31.126
Get up, get up, get up.

03:31.127 --> 03:32.753
- Let me see.
- Well, it's alright.

03:32.754 --> 03:36.423
Now that we know what we're dealing with,
we can come up with a plan.

03:36.424 --> 03:38.176
- Right?
- Definitely.

03:39.177 --> 03:40.969
- Fuck.
- Oh, shit.

03:40.970 --> 03:43.597
Wha-- It's a city, Abs.

03:43.598 --> 03:45.474
I thought it would be like
a tent colony or something.

03:45.475 --> 03:46.892
Well, we knew they had lights.

03:46.893 --> 03:48.518
Yeah, I thought they were
from little generators

03:48.519 --> 03:49.937
- like we use at the FOB.
- Nope.

03:49.938 --> 03:51.688
They got full fuckin' power lines.

03:51.689 --> 03:53.315
Oh, well, isn't that great?

03:53.316 --> 03:54.943
Power lines aren't a problem.

03:55.818 --> 03:57.152
Here are the problems.

03:57.153 --> 03:59.404
They've got four main gates,
no other ins or outs.

03:59.405 --> 04:01.490
Guard towers flanking each exit.

04:01.491 --> 04:04.368
Mounted patrols, all heavily armed,
overlapping routes.

04:04.369 --> 04:05.827
These guys are trained.

04:05.828 --> 04:08.331
Yeah, they've got some vets
down there, for sure.

04:09.499 --> 04:11.334
But, okay.

04:12.335 --> 04:16.296
Let's just say we get past the gates,
the guards, the patrols--

04:16.297 --> 04:17.882
They also got dogs.

04:19.217 --> 04:21.469
'Kay. And the dogs.

04:22.929 --> 04:25.098
We still don't know
where Joel is in there.

04:27.350 --> 04:29.643
Okay, how about this?

04:29.644 --> 04:32.938
We ambush a patrol. We tie 'em up.

04:32.939 --> 04:34.982
- Make 'em tell us where Joel is.
- Make them?

04:34.983 --> 04:36.692
Yeah, we said that we weren't
gonna hurt anyone else.

04:36.693 --> 04:38.652
- Just Joel. I'm not gonna--
- Mel, fuck. Relax.

04:38.653 --> 04:41.780
I'm not saying we would.
I'm saying we bluff.

04:41.781 --> 04:43.199
Scare 'em, you know?

04:44.158 --> 04:46.994
And if they don't talk, then what?

04:46.995 --> 04:49.247
Yeah, it's not like we could let 'em go.

04:55.628 --> 05:00.716
I do have the beginnings
of an idea for a plan, maybe.

05:00.717 --> 05:02.968
Just need some time.
I have to let it crystallize.

05:02.969 --> 05:04.304
But you're onto something?

05:05.680 --> 05:06.764
I'm onto something.

05:07.765 --> 05:11.144
Okay. Then let's buy you some time, then.

05:12.562 --> 05:13.855
I'll take the next watch.

05:14.814 --> 05:15.815
Where's the spot?

05:17.650 --> 05:21.445
Up the hill. A little outcropping.
You'll know it when you see it.

05:21.446 --> 05:22.947
Okay.

05:24.324 --> 05:26.200
Better be a good fuckin' plan.

05:37.170 --> 05:38.880
Oh, fuck.

05:40.715 --> 05:42.216
Fuckin' hour out here?

06:06.366 --> 06:07.950
You don't actually have a plan, do you?

06:09.535 --> 06:10.578
No, I do.

06:12.413 --> 06:16.167
The plan is to convince her to go back.

06:18.669 --> 06:21.756
'Cause if we don't, the only people
getting killed out here are us.

06:33.643 --> 06:35.186
I'm coming.

06:44.028 --> 06:44.986
Hey.

06:44.987 --> 06:46.905
Wow, you look like shit.

06:46.906 --> 06:48.573
Dude, what do you want?

06:48.574 --> 06:52.787
I want you to fulfill your obligation
to the community of Jackson Hole, Wyoming.

06:53.663 --> 06:54.747
8:00 a.m. patrol.

06:55.373 --> 06:56.331
It's eight?

06:56.332 --> 06:59.334
No, it's-- 7:30. But you're riding with me
and I like to be on time.

06:59.335 --> 07:01.170
Okay, gimme a minute, I'll get changed.

07:02.713 --> 07:04.382
I heard you had quite the night
after I left.

07:06.426 --> 07:07.801
Yeah.

07:07.802 --> 07:09.803
Yeah, she kissed me.

07:09.804 --> 07:11.304
It was just Dina being Dina.

07:11.305 --> 07:12.722
She was high, she won't even remember it--

07:12.723 --> 07:17.727
I was talking about some fight
you had with Seth and Joel.

07:17.728 --> 07:18.896
You kissed her?

07:19.772 --> 07:21.773
- No.
- Ellie, come on.

07:21.774 --> 07:23.233
We've been broken up one week,

07:23.234 --> 07:24.693
- and you made a move on her?
- I didn't.

07:24.694 --> 07:25.902
- I didn't make--
- Seriously?

07:25.903 --> 07:27.988
Dina-- you-- It didn't mean anything.

07:27.989 --> 07:29.531
She was probably just trying
to make you jealous.

07:29.532 --> 07:30.949
It didn't mean anything. It didn't.

07:30.950 --> 07:32.659
- I wouldn't do that.
- I'm screwing with you, man.

07:32.660 --> 07:33.827
I already know. I don't care.

07:33.828 --> 07:35.788
Come on, get dressed. We gotta go.

07:36.622 --> 07:37.957
You're the worst.

07:39.709 --> 07:41.377
It's kind of fucked up
you did that, though.

07:43.838 --> 07:45.213
What's everyone doing?

07:45.214 --> 07:46.798
Council put the town on alert.

07:46.799 --> 07:49.426
Last night, Kylie and Max
found a pile of dead infected

07:49.427 --> 07:51.344
near Seven Cabins.

07:51.345 --> 07:53.805
- Frozen stiff.
- Okay?

07:53.806 --> 07:56.224
They didn't think anything of it
until 30 live ones

07:56.225 --> 07:58.977
broke through from underneath the corpses.

07:58.978 --> 08:01.605
They're using their own dead
like insulation.

08:01.606 --> 08:03.899
Thirty? Fuck. They okay?

08:03.900 --> 08:07.486
Yeah, sprinted back on their horses.
Sent a squad out to clear the infected,

08:07.487 --> 08:09.404
but now we're thinking
we don't know how many

08:09.405 --> 08:11.281
are underneath the snow.

08:11.282 --> 08:14.034
Could be 30 more.
Could be a thousand more.

08:14.035 --> 08:16.496
A thousand? Get the fuck outta here.

08:17.079 --> 08:20.790
Ah, yes.
Certainty masquerading as knowledge.

08:20.791 --> 08:22.959
- It's very Ellie of you.
- Suck my dick.

08:22.960 --> 08:25.754
Also, somebody
told the council a ghost story

08:25.755 --> 08:27.547
about the world's smartest infected,

08:27.548 --> 08:29.674
and now everybody's spooked
out of their minds.

08:29.675 --> 08:32.385
It wasn't a ghost story.
You know, no offense, man.

08:32.386 --> 08:34.305
I'm gonna do my patrol with Joel.

08:34.931 --> 08:36.431
Yes, offense,
'cause that's the one person

08:36.432 --> 08:38.058
you've been avoiding like the plague.

08:38.059 --> 08:39.893
Well, we're better now, okay?

08:39.894 --> 08:41.603
As of when? 'Cause last night I did--

08:41.604 --> 08:44.315
Yeah, I know what happened last night.
Can you shut the fuck...

08:51.239 --> 08:52.822
My shit with Joel is complicated.

08:52.823 --> 08:56.409
I know that. From the outside,
it probably looks really bad.

08:56.410 --> 08:57.911
It has been really bad.

08:57.912 --> 09:00.831
But I'm still me,
he's still Joel, and we--

09:03.042 --> 09:05.710
And nothing's ever gonna
change that, ever.

09:05.711 --> 09:07.212
So, you can all stop talking about us,

09:07.213 --> 09:10.048
worrying about us,
and thinking about us, alright?

09:10.049 --> 09:12.051
So, you two hashed it out?

09:14.262 --> 09:15.304
Alright.

09:15.972 --> 09:18.723
Now, if you don't mind,
I'm gonna go on patrol with him

09:18.724 --> 09:20.976
like fucking daddy-daughter day.

09:20.977 --> 09:23.353
- Okay? Okay.
- He already went out.

09:23.354 --> 09:25.605
What? With who?

09:25.606 --> 09:27.857
Dina. They left an hour ago.

09:27.858 --> 09:29.359
For what it's worth,
he wanted to go with you,

09:29.360 --> 09:31.820
but he said we should let you sleep.

09:31.821 --> 09:34.614
- Let's hit the restaurant.
- I'm not hungry.

09:34.615 --> 09:36.449
Neither am I,
but Maria wants to talk to you.

09:36.450 --> 09:38.703
And don't ask. I don't know.

09:39.537 --> 09:41.204
Now, the most likely outcome
is none of this

09:41.205 --> 09:42.665
is necessary, okay?

09:43.708 --> 09:45.333
You wanna remind me next week
how I made y'all

09:45.334 --> 09:47.002
go through all this crap for no reason?

09:47.003 --> 09:49.504
- Yeah.
- Nothin' will make me happier.

09:49.505 --> 09:50.714
But you know the drill.

09:50.715 --> 09:53.883
Prepare for the worst, hope for the best.

09:53.884 --> 09:55.844
Now, half of y'all is hung over
and want me to shut up.

09:55.845 --> 09:57.304
But...

09:57.305 --> 09:59.014
I'ma go through this anyway
'cause it's been a minute.

09:59.015 --> 10:03.643
If you see flares, if you hear bells,
stop what you're doin'.

10:03.644 --> 10:06.230
You follow the plan. What's the plan?

10:06.939 --> 10:08.148
Vanessa, what's the plan?

10:08.149 --> 10:10.358
We go to the forest?

10:10.359 --> 10:11.735
To the forest?

10:11.736 --> 10:15.197
Do not go to the forest, sweetheart.
Be such a bad idea.

10:15.865 --> 10:17.657
Now, young ones, old ones,

10:17.658 --> 10:19.784
right quick into basements and cellars.

10:19.785 --> 10:22.162
You lock the doors,
you reinforce, shelter in place

10:22.163 --> 10:23.622
'til we tell you it's safe to come out.

10:23.623 --> 10:25.248
Now, for the rest of us, where do we go?

10:25.249 --> 10:26.791
- Up!
- Up, that's right.

10:26.792 --> 10:28.918
Rooftops, second floors. What do we bring?

10:28.919 --> 10:30.170
Guns!

10:30.171 --> 10:31.796
- You wanted to--
- That means everyone is carrying

10:31.797 --> 10:32.964
when we're on alert.

10:32.965 --> 10:34.716
Sidearms, rifles, take 'em with you.

10:34.717 --> 10:36.718
Keep 'em on you. Safeties, please.

10:36.719 --> 10:38.303
Somebody shot themselves
in the leg last week.

10:38.304 --> 10:39.804
Earl!

10:39.805 --> 10:41.057
Alright, don't be Earl.

10:42.099 --> 10:44.726
Now, bigger weapons,
security team will handle those.

10:44.727 --> 10:47.605
For the rest of you,
if there's a breach,

10:48.606 --> 10:51.941
God forbid, stay off the main street.

10:51.942 --> 10:54.194
Last place you wanna be,
trust me on that one.

10:54.195 --> 10:55.987
Any questions?

10:55.988 --> 10:58.573
Alright then. Get with your group leaders.

10:58.574 --> 11:00.158
Spread the word to your neighbors.

11:00.159 --> 11:01.910
- Let's get everyone in the loop.
- Go hug Daddy.

11:01.911 --> 11:03.245
Tell him he did good.

11:05.039 --> 11:06.040
Come on.

11:07.875 --> 11:10.502
This is bullshit, right?
It's just a drill.

11:10.503 --> 11:12.087
Yep, it's a drill.

11:12.088 --> 11:14.422
Unless we're attacked, and then it's not.

11:14.423 --> 11:15.966
Correct.

11:17.843 --> 11:20.221
- Oh, fuck me.
- Stay where you are.

11:21.305 --> 11:23.014
Thank you.

11:23.015 --> 11:24.767
Seth, we have something to say?

11:26.227 --> 11:27.395
Yeah.

11:28.062 --> 11:31.314
So, last night,
I obviously had a few too many.

11:31.315 --> 11:33.066
It happens to everyone.

11:33.067 --> 11:35.527
People get drunk and say awful shit
they've never thought before.

11:35.528 --> 11:37.780
- Ellie.
- No, that's fair.

11:39.281 --> 11:40.616
I shouldn't have said it.

11:43.077 --> 11:46.288
I shouldn't even thought it. I'm sorry.

11:48.791 --> 11:52.837
I made you two some sandwiches
if you're going out there.

11:56.048 --> 11:57.466
They're steak.

12:03.472 --> 12:04.765
- Thanks.
- Yeah.

12:05.808 --> 12:06.851
Well...

12:08.394 --> 12:10.354
- You be safe out there.
- Yep.

12:21.073 --> 12:22.783
Cottonwood run, moving out.

12:24.076 --> 12:25.910
Are we worrying about that?

12:25.911 --> 12:27.454
Nah, it'll just be up in the mountains.

12:27.455 --> 12:28.913
Fucking hope so.

12:28.914 --> 12:31.083
Ten seconds in,
I already can't feel my ass.

12:45.639 --> 12:46.807
Goddammit.

12:58.068 --> 12:59.403
Fuck it.

13:38.484 --> 13:40.318
We're runnin' out of rope.

13:40.319 --> 13:41.362
One, two, three.

13:44.615 --> 13:45.658
Rope it.

13:48.160 --> 13:50.329
Take those ammo cans. Put 'em right there.

13:56.961 --> 13:59.547
This is mountaintop patrol.
Visibility dropping.

14:03.384 --> 14:04.552
Mountaintop, repeat.

14:05.469 --> 14:08.138
Again, low visibility.
We're coming back to camp.

14:09.431 --> 14:10.683
Repeat.

14:15.020 --> 14:16.938
- June.
- Yeah?

14:16.939 --> 14:18.731
Go find Amy in the radio room.

14:18.732 --> 14:20.942
Tell her to crank the signal.
Call all the patrols back.

14:20.943 --> 14:22.444
Okay, I'm on it.

14:33.789 --> 14:36.624
Cottonwood patrol, return to Jackson ASAP.

14:36.625 --> 14:37.793
What?

14:40.045 --> 14:42.422
- Repeat.
- Cottonwood patrol,

14:42.423 --> 14:44.883
- return to Jackson ASAP.
- Yeah, alright.

14:44.884 --> 14:47.094
But I think we're too far out
to make it back.

14:49.221 --> 14:51.055
I know a spot, we can hole up there.

14:51.056 --> 14:54.475
Copy. Shelter in place
until we contact you. Stay warm.

14:54.476 --> 14:55.977
Yeah, you too. Over.

14:55.978 --> 14:58.564
- What spot?
- This way.

15:13.412 --> 15:15.622
- They gonna be okay?
- As soon as they eat.

15:15.623 --> 15:17.373
- Okay, what about us?
- This way.

15:17.374 --> 15:18.584
Okay.

15:40.397 --> 15:41.398
Fuck.

15:44.109 --> 15:45.526
Am I fucking hallucinating?

15:45.527 --> 15:49.113
Maybe. Do you see
a 7-Eleven full of weed?

15:49.114 --> 15:50.866
- Yep.
- Then no.

15:55.913 --> 15:57.414
How'd you know about this place?

15:58.415 --> 15:59.500
Eugene.

16:00.501 --> 16:02.086
He was my first patrol partner.

16:02.836 --> 16:05.922
One day, he showed it to me,
said he found it a year earlier

16:05.923 --> 16:07.507
when he was on a solo patrol.

16:07.508 --> 16:09.801
Swore me to secrecy.

16:09.802 --> 16:13.138
Said Maria wouldn't be
supportive of his farming.

16:21.355 --> 16:22.356
You okay?

16:26.652 --> 16:27.820
Yeah.

16:31.407 --> 16:34.534
- Eugene was a Firefly?
- Yup.

16:34.535 --> 16:36.412
Just early on, though.

16:37.121 --> 16:39.205
- Quit back in 2010.
- How come?

16:39.206 --> 16:41.667
He said he was tired of killing people.

16:42.710 --> 16:44.753
I think he was in Vietnam.

16:51.427 --> 16:54.972
That was a raw deal.
Joel having to put him down.

16:57.766 --> 16:59.184
Fuckin' shame.

17:00.477 --> 17:03.772
Guy makes it through a war,
end up going out like that.

17:06.692 --> 17:09.903
What are you gonna do?
Couldn't be saved.

17:11.363 --> 17:12.656
Yeah.

20:37.819 --> 20:38.946
Fuck!

21:43.051 --> 21:47.264
Give me your hand!

21:48.515 --> 21:50.016
- Can you run?
- Yeah.

21:50.017 --> 21:51.935
Run! That way!

22:04.823 --> 22:05.699
Joel?

22:08.160 --> 22:08.993
Joel?

22:08.994 --> 22:11.621
Up here. I'm comin', I'm comin'.

22:13.749 --> 22:14.916
You good?

22:15.709 --> 22:17.501
Hey, kid!

22:17.502 --> 22:19.838
- Yeah, yeah, I'm good.
- Any bites?

22:22.632 --> 22:24.217
Then let's go.

22:26.011 --> 22:26.887
Now!

22:32.559 --> 22:34.226
- What do we do?
- We leave!

22:34.227 --> 22:35.728
Back to Jackson?

22:35.729 --> 22:37.897
It's too far.
We'll freeze before we get halfway.

22:37.898 --> 22:39.648
- I'm aware.
- Where the fuck did they even come from?

22:39.649 --> 22:42.277
- Where did you come from?
- The mountain.

22:45.989 --> 22:48.824
Okay, Joel, if we stay here, we die.
If we go out there, we die.

22:48.825 --> 22:50.326
I don't know, I don't know, I'm thinkin'!

22:50.327 --> 22:54.038
The lodge. My friends are holed up
in a lodge halfway up the mountain.

22:54.039 --> 22:56.874
Not far.
If the infected are down here,

22:56.875 --> 22:59.127
maybe there aren't anymore up there.

23:02.798 --> 23:04.340
Fuck it, it's all we got.
Are your friends armed?

23:04.341 --> 23:05.841
- Yeah.
- Good.

23:05.842 --> 23:07.886
We're gonna need 'em. Get on.

23:19.606 --> 23:22.441
- How we doin'?
- Range is pretty compromised.

23:22.442 --> 23:24.360
But you heard from all of 'em, right?
They're on their way back?

23:24.361 --> 23:25.779
Or taking shelter, yeah.

23:26.780 --> 23:28.240
Except Joel and Dina.

23:29.616 --> 23:32.284
- Well, where the fuck are they?
- I don't know.

23:32.285 --> 23:33.953
They're not responding.

23:33.954 --> 23:35.579
Try 'em again.

23:35.580 --> 23:36.748
Again!

23:39.084 --> 23:41.169
Copper Mine, this is Jackson, come in.

23:46.425 --> 23:47.926
Copper Mine, come in.

23:53.265 --> 23:55.559
Joel, answer the goddamn radio!

24:02.065 --> 24:03.150
Fuck!

24:04.901 --> 24:07.319
Every ten seconds, Amy. You hear me?

24:07.320 --> 24:09.030
Every ten seconds!

24:10.031 --> 24:12.409
Copper Mine, this is Jackson, come in.

24:15.787 --> 24:18.622
- Jesse.
- What?

24:18.623 --> 24:20.292
Check it.

24:22.419 --> 24:23.419
Did he make this?

24:23.420 --> 24:25.588
- Yeah.
- I'm taking this with me.

24:25.589 --> 24:27.673
- No, you're not.
- Yes, I am.

24:27.674 --> 24:30.468
And as much weed
as I can shove into my pack.

24:30.469 --> 24:32.303
- Nope.
- Dude, you're gonna be in charge

24:32.304 --> 24:33.846
of Jackson one day, we all know.

24:33.847 --> 24:35.599
But that day has not yet come.

24:42.481 --> 24:44.024
Repeat.

24:44.691 --> 24:46.692
Copper Mine, do you copy?

24:46.693 --> 24:48.945
This is Jesse, you're barely there. Amy?

24:50.405 --> 24:53.199
Jesse, have you seen Joel or Dina?

24:53.200 --> 24:54.409
Repeat.

24:55.202 --> 24:57.620
Have you heard from Joel or Dina?

24:57.621 --> 24:58.747
No, why?

24:59.831 --> 25:02.708
They haven't checked in.
Are you near Copper Mine?

25:02.709 --> 25:04.711
- Fuck.
- Amy.

25:06.338 --> 25:07.339
Amy, come back.

25:10.258 --> 25:11.259
Amy!

25:44.543 --> 25:46.126
The route's an oval around the mine.

25:46.127 --> 25:48.254
We gotta split up
and come at it from both sides.

25:48.255 --> 25:50.339
Northwest and northeast.
Meet up in the middle.

25:50.340 --> 25:52.716
I'll take northeast.
How much time do you think we have?

25:52.717 --> 25:54.468
If the wind holds steady,
maybe 20 minutes.

25:54.469 --> 25:57.179
You gotta get to the mine by then,
Ellie, whether you find them or not.

25:57.180 --> 25:58.974
Yeah, you fucking too, Jesse.

26:08.608 --> 26:10.359
Joel, we gotta go faster!

26:10.360 --> 26:11.903
I know! I'm tryin'!

27:06.833 --> 27:08.043
Tommy!

27:09.085 --> 27:10.462
Tommy!

27:26.686 --> 27:30.106
Bell! Bell! Hit the bell!

27:36.946 --> 27:38.989
- They're coming!
- Raiders or infected?

27:38.990 --> 27:40.366
Infected! Five minutes out!

27:40.367 --> 27:41.992
Follow the plan. I'll take the roofs.

27:41.993 --> 27:43.370
You take Main Street.

27:45.538 --> 27:46.873
- Go.
- Go! Let's go!

27:48.416 --> 27:50.877
Hey, you two with me! Roofs! Let's go!

27:55.090 --> 28:00.845
Basements and roofs! Get off the street!

28:02.639 --> 28:03.640
Okay.

28:17.529 --> 28:18.530
Hurry!

29:37.484 --> 29:40.486
- Jackson Hole!
- Jackson Hole!

29:40.487 --> 29:41.946
Get ready!

29:55.710 --> 29:57.295
Push! Push!

29:58.588 --> 30:00.256
- Go, go, go!
- Go! Go!

30:01.174 --> 30:02.091
Push!

30:05.261 --> 30:06.262
Push!

30:12.435 --> 30:14.562
Rifles!

30:31.371 --> 30:33.164
Now! Now!

31:30.889 --> 31:32.681
What? Oh, God.

31:32.682 --> 31:34.850
- I have to go back.
- We won't make it.

31:34.851 --> 31:36.895
- If I don't make it, I don't make it.
- We're almost there!

31:38.563 --> 31:41.148
The lodge is just up ahead.
It's like a minute.

31:41.149 --> 31:43.108
- Really?
- We've got blankets, ammo.

31:43.109 --> 31:44.776
My friends can help you get back.

31:44.777 --> 31:46.112
We can fight.

31:51.576 --> 31:52.619
Fast!

32:42.627 --> 32:44.003
They're gonna breach.

32:45.213 --> 32:47.048
They're gonna breach!

32:54.722 --> 32:57.141
They're breaking through! Get ready!

33:01.729 --> 33:03.231
Get in there.

34:46.959 --> 34:48.127
Hey!

34:49.212 --> 34:51.172
Hey! Hey!

34:55.510 --> 34:57.553
Hey! Right here!

34:58.596 --> 34:59.597
Hey!

35:02.433 --> 35:03.893
Come here! Come here!

35:23.579 --> 35:24.664
You good?

35:39.554 --> 35:40.513
No!

35:44.475 --> 35:45.893
Fuck!

36:47.747 --> 36:49.582
Come on, let's go!

37:14.106 --> 37:15.191
Jesus.

37:42.301 --> 37:43.302
Go!

37:46.472 --> 37:47.348
Go!

38:19.505 --> 38:21.257
- Abby!
- Abby!

38:22.133 --> 38:27.304
- Abby!
- Abby!

38:27.305 --> 38:28.805
- Hey, horses!
- Horses!

38:28.806 --> 38:31.100
- Horses!
- We got horses!

38:40.109 --> 38:43.487
Come on. Come on. Inside! Inside!

38:46.240 --> 38:47.658
Abby, you okay?

38:49.535 --> 38:51.162
Oh, fuck.

38:59.086 --> 39:00.171
Help them too.

39:06.594 --> 39:08.887
No, no, no,
let's keep your coat on, alright?

39:08.888 --> 39:12.766
It's okay. I think I see
just a little frostbite on your wrist,

39:12.767 --> 39:15.268
but it's not too bad.
I'm gonna take a look.

39:15.269 --> 39:18.939
Easy. We're gonna raise
your body temperature up slowly, okay?

39:19.732 --> 39:21.775
What's the, who are you?

39:21.776 --> 39:24.194
Hang on. I gotta jump on this,
or you're gonna lose skin.

39:24.195 --> 39:25.820
Okay, everybody grab blankets, ammo,

39:25.821 --> 39:27.364
whatever weapons you have,
we're headin' out

39:27.365 --> 39:29.282
- in three minutes.
- Sorry.

39:29.283 --> 39:31.534
I'm Abby.

39:31.535 --> 39:34.287
This is Nora, Manny, Owen, and Mel.

39:34.288 --> 39:35.705
Jackson, come in.

39:35.706 --> 39:37.792
Tommy, come in. Do you copy?

39:38.793 --> 39:39.793
Her name's Dina.

39:39.794 --> 39:41.378
- Jackson, come in.
- Dina?

39:41.379 --> 39:43.214
- Jackson!
- And he...

39:44.673 --> 39:46.092
is Joel.

39:46.842 --> 39:48.385
Hey, Jackson, do you copy?

39:48.386 --> 39:50.720
Does anyone copy?
Any patrols, anyone?

39:50.721 --> 39:51.805
Tommy, if you can hear me,

39:51.806 --> 39:53.265
- we've got these--
- Joel. Joel. Joel.

40:02.191 --> 40:03.609
We're not gonna hurt her.

40:05.403 --> 40:07.029
Not if you cooperate.

40:08.030 --> 40:10.032
We're just gonna put her
to sleep for a while.

40:12.451 --> 40:14.537
Trust me. It's for the best.

40:16.080 --> 40:17.164
Do it.

40:20.251 --> 40:22.336
If you don't do it, I'm gonna smash her
in the fuckin' head.

40:25.881 --> 40:28.216
You wanna rob us?
Fine, take what you want.

40:28.217 --> 40:30.386
Do we look like raiders to you?

40:35.641 --> 40:36.642
No.

40:37.977 --> 40:39.478
What do we look like?

40:42.606 --> 40:43.816
Military.

40:49.697 --> 40:50.823
Fireflies?

40:51.824 --> 40:52.908
Used to be.

40:53.909 --> 40:55.119
Haven't you heard?

40:56.662 --> 40:58.622
There are no more Fireflies.

41:00.124 --> 41:01.667
They're all gone.

41:09.884 --> 41:10.968
Okay.

41:12.553 --> 41:15.096
- No, get-- Get that shit away from--
- This is gonna put you to sleep.

41:15.097 --> 41:16.764
This is going to put you
to sleep for one hour.

41:16.765 --> 41:18.142
That is all, I promise.

41:19.018 --> 41:20.019
I promise.

41:25.774 --> 41:27.526
No. No. No!

41:38.621 --> 41:41.123
See? Breathing.

41:47.087 --> 41:49.340
That's a nice scar you have
on your right temple there.

41:50.341 --> 41:53.093
I'd say you're about, what, six feet?

41:54.136 --> 41:55.596
In your 60s now?

41:57.306 --> 41:59.767
You actually are pretty handsome.

42:01.101 --> 42:02.186
Congrats on that.

42:07.316 --> 42:10.778
I'm gonna give you one chance
to tell the truth, Joel.

42:11.987 --> 42:15.157
If you do, let's face it.

42:16.116 --> 42:17.701
We'll all know.

42:19.370 --> 42:20.621
I'll let her live.

42:21.622 --> 42:24.083
- Wait, Abby, I thought--
- Shut up!

42:30.422 --> 42:34.218
Where was the last place
you saw the Fireflies?

42:47.314 --> 42:48.691
Salt Lake.

42:52.027 --> 42:53.529
At least you're honest.

42:59.285 --> 43:00.286
I saved your life.

43:01.287 --> 43:02.371
What life?

43:11.088 --> 43:12.131
Tourniquet him.

43:13.173 --> 43:14.800
Mel, let's just do what we came to do.

43:40.826 --> 43:42.119
You're tough.

43:43.662 --> 43:46.624
I guess you probably have to be,
killing all those people.

43:47.708 --> 43:49.585
Do you know how many you killed that day?

43:51.003 --> 43:52.880
Did you count as you went, or...

43:54.131 --> 43:55.924
I guess maybe it just didn't matter?

43:58.927 --> 44:00.763
Eighteen soldiers.

44:02.514 --> 44:04.016
And one doctor.

44:07.478 --> 44:09.063
You remember that one.

44:10.773 --> 44:15.736
An unarmed doctor you shot in the head.

44:19.490 --> 44:20.491
Yeah.

44:22.201 --> 44:23.702
That was my dad.

44:25.954 --> 44:27.706
Guess you probably already figured.

44:30.834 --> 44:32.752
The nurses said you barely
even looked at him

44:32.753 --> 44:34.254
when you pulled the trigger.

44:36.340 --> 44:38.883
And then, you just walked
right past his body

44:38.884 --> 44:40.386
and out the door.

44:43.806 --> 44:45.099
But I looked at him.

44:48.227 --> 44:49.478
I saw him.

44:52.231 --> 44:53.982
I was 19.

45:07.663 --> 45:11.500
I've been in a militia for five years now.

45:12.459 --> 45:15.921
Seattle. I'd warn you not to go there,
but little chance of that.

45:17.047 --> 45:21.760
Anyway, our commander
trained us to follow a code.

45:23.303 --> 45:26.181
We don't kill people
that can't defend themselves.

45:32.604 --> 45:34.189
And right now,

45:36.233 --> 45:37.317
that's you.

45:40.946 --> 45:43.615
But I am going to kill you.

45:46.702 --> 45:52.331
Because it doesn't matter
if you have a code like me

45:52.332 --> 45:56.962
or you're a lawless
piece of shit like you.

46:01.258 --> 46:03.010
There are just some things

46:04.636 --> 46:10.058
everyone agrees are just fucking wrong.

46:47.095 --> 46:49.388
You know, it's funny.
I have waited so long--

46:49.389 --> 46:52.059
Oh, just shut the fuck up
and do it already.

47:16.708 --> 47:17.793
You

47:19.795 --> 47:20.921
stupid

47:22.005 --> 47:23.215
old man.

47:28.011 --> 47:29.888
You don't get to rush this.

48:31.700 --> 48:32.743
Abby.

48:36.163 --> 48:37.164
Abby.

49:22.459 --> 49:23.961
That's enough!

49:29.341 --> 49:30.300
No!

49:33.220 --> 49:34.054
Fuck!

49:42.980 --> 49:44.397
- Stupid fucking bitch!
- No!

49:44.398 --> 49:45.774
No!

49:47.651 --> 49:49.903
- No!
- Joel!

49:50.904 --> 49:52.196
Joel! Joel!

49:52.197 --> 49:53.907
Joel, get up.

49:54.992 --> 49:56.159
Joel, get up.

49:57.494 --> 49:58.870
Joel, fucking get up!

50:00.330 --> 50:02.832
Joel, get up. Get up.

50:02.833 --> 50:03.916
End it.

50:03.917 --> 50:06.920
Joel, get up. Please.

50:08.171 --> 50:11.008
Please, get up. Get up.

50:14.636 --> 50:16.304
Fucking get up!

50:21.309 --> 50:22.686
Get up. Get up.

50:24.396 --> 50:25.814
Get up.

50:32.195 --> 50:33.321
No.

50:35.407 --> 50:37.116
Please, no, please.

50:37.117 --> 50:39.535
Please don't. Please-- please don't.

50:39.536 --> 50:41.328
Please don't do it! Please!

50:41.329 --> 50:46.126
Please don't! Don't!

51:13.028 --> 51:14.446
I'm gonna kill you.

51:16.114 --> 51:17.532
I'm gonna kill you!

51:18.241 --> 51:19.575
You're gonna die!

51:19.576 --> 51:21.620
You're all gonna fucking die!

51:43.183 --> 51:44.893
Fucking pendejo.
